    "1–2 秒最实时；间隔越长越省电。SMC 读取在后台线程执行，不影响界面流畅度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1–2 s is the most responsive; longer intervals save more power. SMC reads run on a background thread and never affect UI smoothness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
