    "LCI 接触液体由白变红；2016 年及以后机型 LCI 在主板与键盘面板上，不拆底壳看不到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LCIs turn from white to red when they touch liquid; on 2016 and later models they sit on the logic board and keyboard panel, so you cannot see them without removing the bottom case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
