    "ProMotion 不显示 120Hz 时排查：Safari 默认把页面渲染限制在 60 FPS——Develop 菜单 → Feature Flags，取消勾选 “Prefer Page Rendering Updates near 60fps” 后刷新页面。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If ProMotion does not show 120 Hz, troubleshoot like this: Safari caps page rendering at 60 FPS by default, so open the Develop menu → Feature Flags, clear the “Prefer Page Rendering Updates near 60fps” checkbox, and reload the page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
