    "macOS 26 及以上先看 系统设置 › 通用 › 关于本机 › 部件与维修，显示器出现在列表里就是换过屏（M5 及更新机型才记录显示屏）。更早机型看 True Tone 原彩和自动亮度是否可用，本应支持却没有该选项通常就是换了非原装屏，再结合边框撬痕判断。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26 and later, first check System Settings › General › About › Parts & Service; if the display appears in the list it has been replaced (only M5 and newer models log the display). On earlier models, check whether True Tone and auto-brightness are available: if the model should support them but the option is missing, the display was probably replaced with a non-original part, which you can confirm by looking for pry marks on the bezel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 26 及以上进入 系统设置 › 通用 › 关于本机 › 部件与维修，会列出检测到的维修并把部件标为正品 Apple 部件、二手 Apple 部件、未知或未验证。这个入口只在检测到维修时才显示，没有入口一般说明没有维修记录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26 and later, open System Settings › General › About › Parts & Service, which lists detected repairs and labels parts as Genuine Apple Part, Used Apple Part, or Unknown or Unverified. This section appears only when a repair is detected, so if it is missing there is usually no service history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 26 及以上：系统设置 › 通用 › 关于本机 › 部件与维修，显示器出现在列表即换过屏（M5 及更新机型才记录显示屏）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On macOS 26 and later, open System Settings › General › About › Parts & Service; if the display appears in the list it has been replaced (only M5 and newer models log the display)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
