    "不通过": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不需要，也不用装任何第三方工具。所有检测（坏点、摄像头、麦克风、扬声器、键盘、触控板、刷新率）都由 MetriBar 在本机完成，不上传任何数据；硬件信息仅通过本机只读命令读取。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No, and you do not need to install any third-party tool: every test (dead pixels, camera, microphone, speakers, keyboard, trackpad and refresh rate) is run locally by MetriBar and uploads nothing; hardware details are read with local read-only commands only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与包装盒标签比对，三处一致才算通过。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compare it with the label on the box; the item passes only if all three match."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与同机型同配置的公开成绩对比，明显偏低说明散热或硬件异常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compare with published scores for the same model and configuration; a clearly lower score points to a cooling or hardware problem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与机身底部刻印比对（若底壳更换过则无刻印，需追问原因）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compare it with the engraving on the bottom case (a replaced bottom case has no engraving, so ask why)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与直营店同型号样机对比，注意破音、偏色、亮度不均。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compare with a display unit of the same model at an Apple Store, watching for distortion, color shift, and uneven brightness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "丰富（图标 + 配色）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rich (icons + colors)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主要影响 2012–2019 款机型，脱落面积大不建议购买。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This mainly affects 2012–2019 models; if a large area has come off, do not buy the Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "买二手 MacBook 付款前必须检查哪些项目？": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which checks must I complete before paying for a used MacBook?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "了解 LCI：机内白色小圆点指示器，接触液体后变红；2016 年及之后机型位于键盘面板和主板，不拆底壳无法看到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Understand what an LCI is: a small white dot inside the Mac that turns red after contact with liquid; on 2016 and later models it sits on the keyboard panel and the logic board, invisible unless you remove the bottom case."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交互": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interactive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亮度检测": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brightness test"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亮度调到最高，从正面与侧面观察四边四角。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set brightness to maximum and check the edges and corners from the front and from the side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅本机只读命令 · 不联网": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only local commands only · No network access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仔细观察屏幕四周边框有无撬压痕迹、胶痕、缝隙不均。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Look closely around the bezel for pry marks, adhesive residue, or uneven gaps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "企业监管机可能被远程锁定或抹除，不要购买；右侧快照已自动核验一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A managed Mac can be locked or erased remotely, so do not buy it; the snapshot on the right has already checked once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "优先用系统自带抹掉：macOS Monterey 及以上、Apple 芯片或带 T2 芯片机型，进入 系统设置 › 通用 › 传输或还原 › 抹掉所有内容与设置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prefer the built-in erase: on macOS Monterey and later with Apple silicon or a T2 chip, open System Settings › General › Transfer or Reset › Erase All Content and Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "传感器库": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sensor library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低电量模式已开启": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Low Power Mode is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "依次播放 左→中→右 提示音，定位清晰、无破音异响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play the left, center, and right tones in turn; each should be clearly positioned with no distortion or rattle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "侧光检查 C 面（键盘面）是否平整，有无翘曲。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With light at a low angle, check that the C side (keyboard deck) is flat and not warped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留原始未剪辑视频，作为退换货或维权凭证。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the original unedited video as evidence for a return or a dispute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先关机并拔掉除电源外的所有外设。Apple 芯片机型按住电源键直到出现启动选项，再按 Command + D；Intel 机型开机后立即按住 D。参考代码 ADP000 表示未发现问题，其他代码即对应硬件故障。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First shut down and unplug every peripheral except the power adapter. On Apple silicon, hold the power button until startup options appear, then press Command + D; on Intel models, hold D immediately after powering on. The reference code ADP000 means no issues were found, while any other code points to a hardware fault."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先过账户与身份关：激活锁已解除、无 MDM 企业锁、序列号三处一致（系统/机身/包装）、「部件与维修」里没有未说明的维修记录、Apple 诊断跑出 ADP000。再看硬件硬伤：屏幕是否原装、有无进水痕迹、坏点、扬声器/麦克风/摄像头、电池健康。全部通过后最后抹盘重装。任一必查项不过都不要付款，其余键盘、接口、外壳等按需选做。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with the account and identity checks: Activation Lock removed, no MDM enrollment, the serial number matching in all three places (macOS, chassis, and box), no unexplained repairs under Parts & Service, and Apple Diagnostics returning ADP000. Then look for physical damage: whether the display is original, signs of liquid damage, dead pixels, the speakers, microphone, and camera, and battery health. Once everything passes, erase the disk and reinstall last. Do not pay if any Must-check item fails; the remaining keyboard, port, and chassis checks are optional."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全自动：转写开始时自动拉起翻译服务，队列跑完自动停止并卸载模型": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fully automatic: the translation service starts with transcription and stops, unloading the model, when the queue finishes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部 %ld 张已发送到打印队列 ✓": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All %ld pages sent to the print queue ✓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部下载缺失（ModelScope）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download all missing (ModelScope)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部停止": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部打印": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Print all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全量重建": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full rebuild"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关机拔外设后进诊断模式，参考代码 ADP000 表示未发现问题。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shut down, unplug external devices, and enter Diagnostics mode; the reference code ADP000 means no issues were found."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关机：完全关闭 MacBook；运行前断开所有外部设备，仅保留键盘、鼠标、显示器、以太网与电源适配器。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shut down: power the MacBook off completely; before running the test, disconnect all external devices except the keyboard, mouse, display, Ethernet, and power adapter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭屏幕，用超细纤维布轻擦屏幕表面。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn the display off and wipe its surface gently with a microfiber cloth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭窗口即停止摄像头（不占用时不耗电）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Closing this window stops the camera (it uses no power when idle)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内存": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内建 ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built-in "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内置拟真键盘画布：逐个按键实时点亮并计数，不触发或串键即为故障。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The built-in realistic keyboard canvas lights up and counts every key in real time; keys that do not respond or that trigger the wrong key are faults."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内置硬盘": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Internal drive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再到 Apple「检查覆盖范围」页面输入序列号，核对机型与保修状态是否匹配。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then enter the serial number on Apple's Check Coverage page and confirm that the model and warranty status match."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再在全黑房间把亮度调到最高，看四角是否有明显漏光。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then, in a completely dark room with brightness at maximum, check the corners for obvious backlight bleed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再想想": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never mind"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再检查 系统设置 → 显示器 → 刷新率 是否设为 ProMotion；新版 Chrome 已支持 macOS 120Hz，若仍停在 60 可换浏览器复测。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then check that System Settings → Displays → Refresh Rate is set to ProMotion; recent Chrome versions support 120 Hz on macOS, so if it is still stuck at 60, retest in another browser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再测双指滚动、三指拖动与用力点按（Force Touch）手感是否一致。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Then test two-finger scrolling, three-finger dragging, and force clicking (Force Touch) for a consistent feel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "准备中": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preparing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "准备中（启动翻译引擎）…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preparing (starting translation engine)…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出现未说明的换屏、换电池记录需向卖家追问，或直接放弃。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If there is an unexplained display or battery replacement, question the seller or walk away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换后需重启 App 生效。中英文档分文件：README.md / README.en.md。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes effect after restarting the app. Documentation ships as two files: README.md / README.en.md."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除全部": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete all"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除运行时与依赖": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete runtime & dependencies"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到 Apple 官方页面输入序列号，验证保修状态与设备信息。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the serial number on Apple's official page to verify the warranty status and device information."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刷新打印机列表": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh printer list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刷新率检测": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh rate test"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刷新间隔": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh interval"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加入队列": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add to Queue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "华氏度 (°F)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fahrenheit (°F)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单位": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Units"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "单手握持机身晃动，屏幕不应自由翻转（转轴松动）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the base with one hand and shake it gently; the lid should not swing freely, which would mean a loose hinge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原装屏幕核验": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Original display check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "反复 5 次观察识别率，明显迟钝可能是传感器老化。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Repeat five times to check the recognition rate; if it is clearly slow, the sensor may be worn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "反复开合 10 次：阻尼均匀无异响，任意角度可悬停。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open and close the lid ten times: the resistance should be even with no noise, and the lid should hold at any angle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "反复开合屏幕 10 次，感受阻尼是否均匀、有无异响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open and close the lid ten times and feel whether the resistance is even and free of abnormal noise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可再点一次「开始」复测": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Start again to retest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可用 %.0f GB / 总 %.0f GB（%.0f%% 已用）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%.0f GB free / %.0f GB total (%.0f%% used)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能是麦克风被其他 App 占用，关闭后重试": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Another app may be using the microphone; close it and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右侧「本机硬件快照」已直接读出全部电池数据：健康度、循环次数、设计/满充容量、电压电流温度、序列号，无需安装任何第三方 App。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The This Mac hardware snapshot on the right already shows all battery data directly: health, cycle count, design and full charge capacity, voltage, current, temperature, and serial number, with no third-party app needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右侧「磁盘 SMART」为系统自动核验结果，Verified 即正常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disk SMART on the right is the system's automatic check; Verified means it is healthy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右侧硬件快照已自动读取系统激活锁状态，可辅助核对。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hardware snapshot on the right already reads the system Activation Lock status and can help you cross-check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同时处理 %ld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Process %ld at a time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动诊断 · Apple 芯片：按住电源键直到看到启动选项，然后按 Command (⌘) + D。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start diagnostics on Apple silicon: hold the power button until startup options appear, then press Command (⌘) + D."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动诊断 · Intel 芯片：开机后立即按住 D；如果无效，再尝试 Option (⌥) + D。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start diagnostics on Intel: hold D immediately after powering on; if that does not work, try Option (⌥) + D."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喷头堵塞检测": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nozzle check"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "四色细线阵：断线=堵头。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Four-color hairline array: gaps mean clogged nozzles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回放应清晰、无明显底噪或断续；首次使用会请求麦克风权限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Playback should be clear with no obvious background noise or dropouts; the first run asks for microphone permission."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在全黑房间，显示纯黑画面（可用坏点检测的全屏黑）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a completely dark room, display a pure black screen (the full-screen black of the dead pixel test works)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在多个位置移动，观察是否频繁掉线（天线故障征兆）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move around several locations and watch for frequent disconnects, which point to an antenna fault."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在手表上打开「广播心率」（活动 · 设置里，或下拉快捷面板的心率广播）。首次会弹出「允许 MetriBar 使用蓝牙」。macOS 无 ANT+，走 BLE 标准心率服务。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on “Broadcast Heart Rate” on the watch (Activities · Settings, or the heart-rate broadcast tile in the shortcut panel). The first run asks “Allow MetriBar to use Bluetooth”. macOS has no ANT+, so MetriBar uses the standard BLE heart-rate service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在终端运行 profiles status -type enrollment，两行都显示 No 才正常。更可靠的方法是抹机后联网进入设置助理，出现「远程管理」页面就说明被企业注册监管，这类机器可能被远程锁定或抹除，不要购买。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run profiles status -type enrollment in Terminal; both lines must read No. A more reliable method is to erase the Mac and go through Setup Assistant while online: a Remote Management page means it is enrolled in corporate management, and such machines can be locked or erased remotely, so do not buy them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在菜单栏显示心率": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show heart rate in the menu bar"
