          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如需拆底壳（卖家允许时）：关机断电 → 五角星 P5 螺丝刀拧下 8–10 颗螺丝（记录位置，长短不同）→ 从转轴一侧撬起掀开 → 在主板与键盘面板找 2–3mm 小纸点，白色正常、红色进水；切勿硬撬或触碰主板。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you need to open the bottom case (with the seller's permission): shut down and unplug power → remove the 8–10 screws with a P5 pentalobe driver (note their positions, since the lengths differ) → pry the case open from the hinge side → look for 2–3 mm paper dots on the logic board and keyboard panel: white is normal and red means liquid damage; never force the case or touch the logic board."
          }
        }
      }
    },
