          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag in videos, or click \"Add video\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拷贝数 GB 大文件，观察速度是否稳定、是否掉盘。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy a few GB of large files and watch whether the speed stays steady and the drive stays connected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按提示操作：依系统版本可能先要求选择语言，或选择要运行的检测项目。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
