    "接上 MagSafe 磁吸头，应自动吸附并亮起充电指示灯。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attach the MagSafe connector; it should snap into place and light up the charging indicator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接充电器，确认充电指示与功率正常；需调整角度才通电 = 接口松旷。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect the charger and confirm that charging and power delivery are normal; if you must wiggle the plug to get power, the port is loose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接外接显示器或转接器，确认视频输出正常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect an external display or adapter and confirm that video output works."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接电源": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connected to power"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接电源、关闭后台程序，跑 CPU 单核/多核与 GPU 测试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect power, quit background apps, and run the CPU single-core, multi-core, and GPU tests."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接触包装前就开始录像，直到开机前不要停：拍清盒子六个面、纸质拉条、盒上序列号并核对机身一致。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start recording before you touch the packaging and keep recording until the Mac is powered on: show all six sides of the box, the paper pull tab, and the serial number on the box, then verify it matches the machine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
