    "最大容量 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maximum capacity %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最高亮度下与同机型对比，明显偏暗说明背光老化。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At maximum brightness, compare with the same model; if it is clearly dimmer, the backlight has aged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有条件时带自己的素材与耳机做 A/B 对比。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you can, bring your own material and headphones for an A/B comparison."
          }
