    "机身与外观检查": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chassis and appearance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "权限不足（终端：sudo profiles status -type enrollment）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insufficient permissions (Terminal: sudo profiles status -type enrollment)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "松手后应在数秒内完全恢复；出现永久暗斑说明屏幕已受损。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The image should fully recover within seconds of releasing; a permanent dark patch means the display is damaged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查「部件与维修」+ True Tone/自动亮度是否可用 + 边框撬痕。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check Parts & Service, whether True Tone and auto-brightness work, and whether the bezel shows pry marks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看固态硬盘健康状态与剩余寿命（右侧快照已给出 SMART 与累计读写）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the SSD health status and remaining life (the snapshot on the right already shows SMART data and total reads and writes)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看实时画面：清晰、无横纹黑块。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the live image: it should be sharp with no horizontal lines or black blocks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看结果：记录参考代码（ADP000 = 未发现问题），其他代码即对应硬件故障，逐条向卖家追问，然后按屏幕选项重启或关机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review the results: note the reference code (ADP000 = no issues found); any other code points to a hardware fault, so ask the seller about each one, then choose Restart or Shut Down on screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看详细日志": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View detailed log"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标准模式": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "校验中…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verifying…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "样式=丰富": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "style=rich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "样式=紧凑": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "style=compact"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "核对配件清单：电源适配器功率、充电线与说明文档是否符合 Apple 官方规格。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the included accessories: confirm that the power adapter wattage, charging cable, and documentation match Apple's official specifications."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查包装完整性：约 2022 年起的较新包装已无塑封膜、改为纸质拉条，确认拉条或塑封完好、无二次封装痕迹。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check that the packaging is intact: newer boxes from around 2022 on have no shrink wrap and use a paper pull tab instead, so confirm the tab or wrap is undamaged and shows no sign of being resealed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查四角与边缘有无磕碰、掉漆，壳缝是否均匀。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the corners and edges for dents and chipped paint, and that the case seams are even."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查屏幕是否有键盘压痕、亮斑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the display for keyboard imprints and bright spots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查机身是否有凹痕、划痕、裂缝或氧化。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the chassis for dents, scratches, cracks, or oxidation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查端口残留：灯光照入 USB-C 等端口查看腐蚀、水渍圈或黏腻残留；老款 MagSafe 口周围是进水高发点。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the ports for residue: shine a light into the USB-C and other ports to look for corrosion, watermarks, or sticky residue; the area around the older MagSafe connector is a common liquid-damage spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查耳机孔（仅老机型）：用手电照 3.5mm 耳机孔可见 LCI——白色正常、红色进水；较新机型外部看不到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the headphone jack (older models only): shine a flashlight into the 3.5 mm jack to see the LCI — white is normal and red means liquid damage; newer models show nothing from the outside."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查腐蚀迹象：端口边缘、扬声器开孔与散热孔是否有白色/绿色残留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check for corrosion: look for white or green residue around the port edges, speaker grilles, and vents."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查风扇有无异响，负载时散热是否正常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the fan for abnormal noise and that cooling works under load."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到 %ld 台 · 默认 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detected %ld printer(s) · default %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测扬声器与屏幕表现，建议到直营店对比体验。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check speaker and display performance; comparing at an Apple Store is recommended."
          }
        }
      }
    },
