            "value": "Steps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每 1 秒自动刷新并滚动到底部": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refreshes every second and scrolls to the bottom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个 USB-C / 雷电口分别插入 U 盘，确认能正常读写文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plug a USB flash drive into each USB-C / Thunderbolt port and confirm that you can read and write files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个口分别测数据传输、外接显示与充电，松旷即异常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test data transfer, external display output, and charging on every port; a loose fit is a fault."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有该选项时进恢复模式 · Apple 芯片：关机后按住电源键直到「正在载入启动选项」，点「选项」›「继续」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If that option is missing, enter Recovery mode on Apple silicon: shut down, hold the power button until Loading startup options appears, then click Options › Continue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有该选项时进恢复模式 · Intel 芯片：重启后立即按住 Command (⌘) + R 直到出现苹果标志。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If that option is missing, enter Recovery mode on Intel: restart and immediately hold Command (⌘) + R until the Apple logo appears."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "注册失败：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registration failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "注意检查串键（按 A 亮 B）与连击。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also watch for wrong-key output (pressing A lights up B) and double presses."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "注意：进水会导致保修失效并留下间歇性故障；沿海潮湿环境极少数情况下 LCI 会因长期高湿度变红，需结合其他迹象判断。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note: liquid damage voids the warranty and can leave intermittent faults; in rare cases, long-term humidity in damp coastal climates turns LCIs red, so judge together with other signs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
