    "点「开始」录制约 5 秒，随后自动回放。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Start to record for about five seconds; playback starts automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点「开始」打开实时预览窗口（首次会请求摄像头权限）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Start to open the live preview window (the first run asks for camera permission)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点「开始」进入全屏纯色画面，空格或 → 切换颜色，Esc 退出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click Start to enter the full-screen solid colors; press Space or → to change color and Esc to exit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击本区域取得焦点，然后逐个按下每个键（F 键无反应请按 fn+F）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click this area to focus it, then press each key one by one (if the F keys do not respond, press fn+F)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击测试区取得焦点，按下每个键——应实时点亮并计数。Esc 退出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click the test area to focus it, then press each key — keys should light up and be counted in real time. Press Esc to exit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点右侧按钮一键构建（首次约 3–15 分钟）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Build with the button on the right (first run takes about 3–15 min)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
