    "用 F1 / F2 走完亮度全行程，观察是否有跳变或闪烁。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press F1 / F2 through the full brightness range and watch for jumps or flicker."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用 Geekbench 跑分对比同机型公开成绩。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Geekbench scores to compare with published results for the same model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用 UFO Test 测试屏幕刷新率是否达标。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use UFO Test to check that the display meets its refresh rate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用于": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "for"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用单指连续画圈、直线覆盖四角与边缘：应跟手无断线。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Draw continuous circles and straight lines with one finger to cover all four corners and edges: tracking should be smooth with no breaks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用坏点检测页全屏切换红、绿、蓝、白、黑纯色画面，逐色观察有没有固定不变的亮点或黑点。再在全黑房间把亮度调到最高看四角有无明显漏光，轻微均匀的边缘泛光属正常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the dead pixel test to switch the full screen through solid red, green, blue, white, and black, checking each color for bright or dark dots that never change. Then, in a completely dark room with brightness at maximum, check the corners for obvious backlight bleed; faint, even edge glow is normal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用手遮挡镜头再移开，观察曝光响应是否正常。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cover the lens with your hand and then move it away to check that exposure responds normally."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用无纺布或超细纤维布轻压屏幕四角与边缘。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press the four corners and edges of the display gently with a non-woven or microfiber cloth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用无纺布轻压屏幕四角，观察是否出现黑斑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press the four corners of the display gently through a non-woven cloth and watch for dark patches."
          }
        }
      }
