      }
    },
    "系统设置 › Apple 账户 › iCloud › 查找：确认「查找我的 Mac」已关闭。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go to System Settings › Apple Account › iCloud › Find My and confirm that Find My Mac is turned off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置 › Touch ID 与密码：录入一枚新指纹。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings › Touch ID & Password and enroll a new fingerprint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置 › 你的名字 › iCloud › 查找我的 Mac，确认已关闭且系统里不再显示前机主的 Apple 账户。最保险的做法是让卖家当面「抹掉所有内容和设置」，抹机后进入设置助理若不要求输入前机主密码，才算真正解锁。仍有激活锁的 Mac 绝对不能买。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings › your name › iCloud › Find My Mac and confirm that it is off and that the previous owner's Apple Account no longer appears in the system. The safest approach is to have the seller erase all content and settings in front of you; the Mac is only truly unlocked if Setup Assistant does not ask for the previous owner's password. Never buy a Mac that still has Activation Lock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置 › 通用 › 关于本机 › 部件与维修：查看维修记录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings › General › About › Parts & Service to review the service history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置 › 通用 › 关于本机：读出序列号（右侧快照也已自动读取）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings › General › About and read the serial number (the snapshot on the right reads it automatically too)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 摄像头：勾选 MetriBar 后重试": {
