          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a model folder (containing SenseVoiceSmall and other subfolders) · ⌘⇧. shows hidden folders"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐色观察是否有固定不变的亮点（卡点）或黑点（坏点）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In each color, look for bright dots that never change (stuck pixels) or dark dots (dead pixels)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "递减线宽分辨率测试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decreasing line widths for resolution."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pass"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部件会标注「正品 Apple 部件 / 二手 Apple 部件 / 未知或未验证」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
